# The People page's character sheets (euphonia.sheets.json): pages to read,
# each written by the book's sheet generator with its styles inline, in
# style attributes the site's policy (public/.htaccess) refuses. Here, and
# only here, inline styles are allowed, and nothing else runs: no script at
# all, nothing loaded from elsewhere, no forms, no frames. verify-euphonia
# holds every sheet in this folder script-free and self-contained (Scott,
# 15 November 2026). This replaces the site's policy for this folder; the
# other security headers still come from public/.htaccess.
<IfModule mod_headers.c>
  Header set Content-Security-Policy "default-src 'none'; style-src 'unsafe-inline'; img-src data:; script-src 'none'; base-uri 'none'; form-action 'none'; frame-ancestors 'none'"
</IfModule>
